    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0050_new_sys_01",
      "hash": "9776b8c56518fb6e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR POKNAME(0002)]成为了\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]的宝可梦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0050_new_doctor_01",
      "hash": "7071372226a8744e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：一会儿进一会儿出，\\n真是个奇怪的家伙唷！\\c\\n不过，它似乎\\n很喜欢[VAR TRNAME(0000)]呐！\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！要不你就给\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]取个名字吧？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0050_rival_02",
      "hash": "b021c45d8a7475f7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：博士，\\n我决定就选它了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0050_sys_03",
      "hash": "5ad65770906b6c33",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]从大木博士那里\\n得到了[VAR POKNAME(0004)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0050_rival_03",
      "hash": "b021c35d8a747444",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：真可爱啊！\\n我想要[VAR POKNAME(0004)]很久了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0050_poke_01",
      "hash": "11919cc256f0c6cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 18]"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0050_poke_02",
      "hash": "119199c256f0c1b4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 19]"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0050_doctor_04",
      "hash": "21776adbcdc3fc1c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大木博士：没想到初出茅庐的训练家\\n居然可以自己捉到最初的宝可梦！\\c\\n你这种情况\\n连我都是第一次遇到唷！"
    }
